# W058 — the Three.js renderer adapter's local (pre-registration) link state.
#
# adapters/renderers/threejs is a NESTED package path that the frozen
# pnpm-workspace.yaml glob ("adapters/*") does not match, so until the Tech
# Lead's registration pass adds the glob entry, scripts/link-local.mjs
# builds a gitignored local node_modules (workspace-package symlinks + the
# catalog-pinned three staged from the registry) plus a .local-stage tree.
# Post-registration pnpm owns node_modules directly and none of this exists.
# Nothing here is ever committed.
node_modules
.local-stage
*.tsbuildinfo
